# Patterns of URLs lychee should skip during link checks.
# One regex per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.

# Microsoft's CDN (Akamai) returns 500 to CI/bots; the link works fine in a browser.
^https://www\.microsoft\.com/microsoft-365/excel

# State Dept per-diem pages (old ASP gov site) intermittently block CI / time out.
# Links are correct and are the authoritative rate source — kept in the README on purpose.
^https://aoprals\.state\.gov/

# Placeholder links in code-block examples.
example\.com
